{"id":"n1-163","title":"Verbる なり (Verb-ru nari)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses 'as soon as' or 'the moment'.","longExplanation":"Verbるなり indicates that the following action happens immediately after the verb action. It can be translated as 'no sooner than...', 'as soon as...', or 'the moment...'.","formation":"Verb-dictionary form + なり","examples":[{"jp":"家に帰るなり、すぐに寝た。","romaji":"Ie ni kaeru nari, sugu ni neta.","en":"As soon as I got home, I went to sleep.","words":[{"surface":"家","vocabId":"1191730","reading":"いえ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"帰る","vocabId":"1221270","reading":"かえる"},{"surface":"なり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すぐ","vocabId":"1430610","reading":"すぐ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"寝","vocabId":"1642760","reading":"ね"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"彼が駅に着くなり、電話をかけてきた。","romaji":"Kare ga eki ni tsuku nari, denwa o kakete kita.","en":"He called me the moment he arrived at the station.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"駅","vocabId":"1175140","reading":"えき"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"着く","vocabId":"1422970","reading":"つく"},{"surface":"なり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"電話","vocabId":"1443840","reading":"でんわ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"かけ","vocabId":"1590040","reading":"かけ"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"き","vocabId":"1221520","reading":"き"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"ドアを開けるなり、犬が吠え始めた。","romaji":"Doa o akeru nari, inu ga hoe hajimeta.","en":"As soon as I opened the door, the dog started barking.","words":[{"surface":"ドア","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"開ける","vocabId":"1202450","reading":"あける"},{"surface":"なり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"犬","vocabId":"1258330","reading":"いぬ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":nul